<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov rubber imports up 67.9 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov rubber imports up 67.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports of natural rubber, including latex, in the first 11 months of 1996 were 470,000 tonnes, up 67.9 percent from the same period last year, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>In November alone, imports of natural rubber, including latex, were 60,000 tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Imports of synthetic rubber, including latex, in January-November were 324,759 tonnes, up 18.2 percent from the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>Imports of synthetic rubber in November alone were 37,675 tonnes.</p>
</text>
